  "readmeFile": "README.md",
  "releaseNotes": "v3.0.1\n- Updated copyright attribution, and added SPDX-License-Identifier headers\n- Updated blog links to HTTPS\n- Added consumer-level NativeAOT publish and execution smoke test in CI/Release\n\nv3.0.0\n- Multi-targeted for netstandard2.0, net8.0, and net10.0 (dropped netstandard1.0)\n- Enabled nullable reference types, trimming/NativeAOT compatibility, and built-in Source Link\n- Added ReadOnlySpan<char> overloads (net8.0+), zero-allocation static methods (stackalloc/ArrayPool on net8.0+, capped thread-local cache on netstandard2.0), capped instance buffer retention, lazy maxDistance initialization, SIMD CommonPrefixLength, and O(1) fast paths\n- Fixed Similarity returning 1.0 when one string is a prefix or suffix of the other\n- Fixed inverted null handling in Similarity.DamerauOSA and Helpers.NullSimilarityResults\n- Fixed fractional and NaN maxDistance handling in Levenshtein.Distance and DamerauOSA.Distance\n- Added missing ISimilarity interface declaration to DamerauOSA",
